1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Die Inschriften des Alten Judenfriedhofes in Wien" Band II- by Dr. Bernhard Wachstein- no. 771, pages 151-157
2 CONT
2 CONT Die Inschriften des Alten Judenfriedhofes in Wien" Band II- by Dr. Bernhard Wachstein- pg. 295, 65
2 CONT
2 CONT Her father is likely either  http://www.geni.com/people/David-Tewle-Schiff/6000000009285906233 or  http://www.geni.com/people/David-Schiff-KaZ/6000000010986598568
2 CONT
2 CONT Wachstein, Vol II page 156-7 first says it is doubtful (zweifelhaft) that she is the daughter of the David Schiff (listed second above) who died October 21, 1697, but then goes on to say that he guesses she is the daughter of the 
2 CONC David Schiff who was the father-in-law of Berend Cohen, which is the same one!
