2 CONC ther of Eva Warburg who organized Kindertransport to Sweden in 1938 and -39. Louisa Warburg (1879–1973), married to Julius Derenberg (1873–1928) Walter Julius Derenberg (1903–1975), legal scholar Relatives Emil Warburg, (1846–1931
