2 CONC  Record Role: 10450:32565152:  <p>Weekly Times (VIC)<br />Publication: Nov 16 1918 - Victoria, Australia<br />Text: "...where revolutionary troops used machine guns, and many were killed. HERR BALLIX'S SUICIDE According to a repor
2 CONC t from Amster dam, Herr <span style="background-color: yellow; font-weight: bold; padding: 2px;">Albert</span> <span style="background-color: yellow; font-weight: bold; padding: 2px;">Ballin</span>, Germany's "shipping- king," sho
2 CONC t himself in his..."</p>
