1 NAME Mariane /Behrens/
2 GIVN Mariane
2 SURN Behrens
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 10 NOV 1820
2 ADDR
3 CITY Lüneburg
3 STAE Lower Saxony
3 CTRY Germany
