1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Note: There is NO evidence as yet that Mariane married. There is an Oskar Fehr (1871-1959) on Wikipedia but he is very unlikely to be Mariane's son as Mariane was 51 when Oskar Fehr was born. Additionally Mariane's
2 CONC  death was notified by her nephew and the name Fehr does not appear on her death certificate. Probably someone has made a guess that she had a husband and the error is being propagated between family history sites.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Philipp and Adele Behrens’ second child Mariane was born in Lüneburg on 10 November 1820. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On findagrave.com, Mariane Behrens died aged eighty one years and eight months on 9 August 1902 and she was buried on 12 August in plot B10 Nr105 of the Jüdischer Friedhof Ohlsdorf Cemetery in Hamburg-Nord. The JewishGen website b
2 CONC urial registry gave her address as Ernst-Merck-Strasse 20. 
2 CONT Her death certificate adds that the business man Richard Philipp Behrens notified the death, Richard Behrens being her nephew, the son of her brother Bernhard.
