1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The first black Jamaican millionaire 
2 CONT
2 CONT Another popular attraction in Jamaica’s capital is the Devon House, the former residence of Jamaica’s first black millionaire, whose father, by the way, was Jewish.
2 CONT
2 CONT George Stiebel was the offspring of a German Jewish father and a black Jamaican housekeeper, and he allegedly made his fortune when he purchased an abandoned gold mine and discovered gold in it, explains museum guide Marcia Riley 
2 CONC Brown. His beautiful mansion is now famous for the best Jamaican ice cream, sold on the premises.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.timesofisrael.com/remnants-of-jamaicas-jews-hold-a-heritage-full-of-firsts/
