1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Baron Lionel Nathan de Rothschild (22 November 1808 – 3 June 1879) was a British Jewish banker, politician and philanthropist who was a member of the prominent Rothschild banking family of England. He became the f
2 CONC irst practising Jew to sit as a Member of Parliament in the House of Commons of the United Kingdom."
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1839, Austrian Generalkonsul in London.
