1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT "Louisa de Rothschild (née Montefiore), Lady de Rothschild (28 May 1821 – 22 September 1910), was an Anglo-Jewish philanthropist, and founding member of the Union of Jewish Women."
2 CONT
2 CONT =================================
2 CONT
2 CONT Links:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louisa_de_Rothschild
