2 CONC age and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT
2 CONT [S35] Peter Townend, editor, Burke's Genealogical and Heraldic History of the Landed Gentry, 18th edition, 3 volumes (London, England: Burke's Peerage Ltd, 1965-1972), volume 1, page 506. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Landed Gentry
