1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Probate 1978 of LILY EMMA BEHRENS of 57 Hewitt Rd London NW3 died 15 November 1977 Probate London 1 February £4056
2 CONT
2 CONT (Lily’s address ‘Hewitt Road’ is almost certainly a transcription error as Hewitt Road is in London N8 not NW3.  Note that her sister Alice Helen Behrens’s address was 57 Howitt Road Hampstead London NW3 in both 1948 and 1993. It 
2 CONC is likely that Lily and Alice, when forced to leave Germany, chose to live near their second cousin Marie Adele Lewenz, who was living at 30 Howitt Road Hampstead in 1933.)
