3 STAE Vienna
3 CTRY Austria
1 DEAT
2 DATE 12 MAR 1943
2 PLAC Theresienstadt Ghetto
2 ADDR
1 OCCU Fabrikbesitzer - factory owner
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born on July 6, 1860 and deported to Theresienstadt on September 10, 1942.  No further information known after that date, though one must assume that he was probably deported to a camp further east where he eventua
2 CONC lly succumbed to the harsh regime (after all, he was over 80 years of age by that time) or was exterminated in one way or the other.  I would think that the year 1943 is the most likely year of his death, as it was with most peopl
2 CONC e deported in the year 1942.
2 CONT
2 CONT His last address in Vienna is given as: Wien 2, Komoediengasse 6/16 i.e. house number 6, flat 16.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is mentioned in "Totenbuch Theresienstadt - Deportierte aus Oesterreich".
2 CONT
2 CONT Comment by Paul Hugo Meyer
2 CONT
2 CONT ==DOW:==
