2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Married to Delphine Weiller Roos and had seven children: Lucien who married Violette, Mathilde who married Max and had a daughter Colette, David who never married, Armand (Lecie&apos;s grandfather), Hortense who married Achille Le
2 CONC vy and had 2 children Jean and Robert, Bernard who married Hermine and had 2 children Jacques and George, and Hedy who married Sylvan Bicard.
2 CONT
2 CONT Raphael had a store in Haugenau and lived over it.  The location is now a factory where they make M&amp;M&apos;s for European distribution (85 Grand Rue, Haugenau).
2 CONT
2 CONT Raphael&apos;s son, David T. Roos (b. 8/13/1895, d. 2/15/1960) came to Shreveport.  We believe that his brother, Armand, sent for David after he had enough money to do so, but no one knows.  David lived and worked with Armand.
