2 CONT She inherited the Villa Wertheimstein, and in 1907 bequeathed it and its associated park on the main street of Oberdöbling (once an independent municipality and now a district in Vienna) to the city with the stipulations that the 
2 CONC park be open to the public, that the premises include a public library and that the villa's salon be preserved as a cultural-historical monument.
