1 CONT Sara was the daughter of Leopold Edler von Herz and Karoline
1 CONT (Charlotte Shendel) von Arnstein.  In 1817, she was living inWien,
1 CONT Austria at Stadt 956.  She was baptized on May 18, 1819 in Wien,
1 CONT Austria at the Am Hof Church.
1 CONT At the time of her death, Sara was living in Wien, Austria at
1 CONT Singerstrabe 2.  She was buried in Wien, Austria at the Central
1 CONT Cemetery.
